Test Case 2:
Analyze the variation of cutoff frequencies of Electromagnetic waves between parallel plates with for TEI, TE2, TE 3 and TE4 modes.

AIM: To analyze the variation of cutoff frequencies of Electromagnetic waves between parallel plates with for TEI, TE2, TE 3 and TE4 modes.

CODE:
clc;
clear;
close;
// Parallel plate waveguide
a = 7.62*(10^-2);
V = 3*(10^8);
printf("Mode\tCutoff Frequency (GHz)\n");
printf("--------------------------------\n");
for m = 1:4
// Cutoff frequency
fc = (V/(2*%pi))sqrt((m%pi/a)^2);
printf("TE%d\t%f\n",m,fc*(10^-9));
end

